n.", "5": "Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions.", "6": "Switch legs and repeat the movement.", "7": "She returns to the exact position and pose of second 0 so the clip loops seamlessly."}'::jsonb, false FROM exercise WHERE slug = 'smith-single-leg-split-squat';
